    "body": "Oh, well that's silly of me.\r\n\r\nI'd been using absolute minimum dependencies for install, which meant that `git` simply wasn't in the PKGBUILD or the chroot (since you didn't actually need git installed to build/test `starship` before the most recent changes).\r\n\r\n@wyze  Does the new starship code reference the external `git` program anywhere else but the tests? A code search suggests no, but I'd like to be sure. If it's only in the test, I can add git to `checkdepends`, while if it's elsewhere I'll also need to add it to `depends`.",
